o>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Statement III is false. Since the intersection is not empty, the two sets are not disjoint.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
