    "q-174400": {
      "dom_id": "step-q174400",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "$\\{-6,6\\}⊔\\{-3,3\\}=$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{-6,6\\}\\cap \\{-3,3\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{-6,6\\}⊔\\{-3,3\\} & =\\{-6,6\\}\\cup \\{-3,3\\} \\\\  & =\\{-6,-3,3,6\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
