      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "$\\{1,2,3\\}⊔\\{4,6\\}=$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{1,2,3\\}\\cap \\{4,6\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{1,2,3\\}⊔\\{4,6\\} & =\\{1,2,3\\}\\cup \\{4,6\\} \\\\  & =\\{1,2,3,4,6\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
