      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "$\\{2,4,6\\}⊔\\{1,3,5\\}=$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{2,4,6\\}\\cap \\{1,3,5\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{2,4,6\\}⊔\\{1,3,5\\} & =\\{2,4,6\\}\\cup \\{1,3,5\\} \\\\  & =\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
