    },
    "q-172559": {
      "dom_id": "step-q172559",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "Find the disjoint union of the sets $\\{a,b,c\\}$ and $\\{1,2\\}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n\\{a,b,c\\}\\cap \\{1,2\\}=∅.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\{a,b,c\\}⊔\\{1,2\\} & =\\{a,b,c\\}\\cup \\{1,2\\} \\\\  & =\\{a,b,c,1,2\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
